---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-950 text-slate-300">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-6 py-14 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr_0.8fr] lg:px-8">
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white">
        <img src="/logo.png" alt="EmerCard" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-2xl bg-white object-contain" />
        <span class="text-lg font-extrabold tracking-tight">EmerCard</span>
      </a>
      <p class="max-w-sm text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Hồ sơ y tế khẩn cấp rõ ràng hơn khi mỗi giây đều quan trọng.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Khám phá</p>
      <nav class="mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm" aria-label="Liên kết chân trang">
        <a href="/" class="transition hover:text-sky-300">Trang chủ</a>
        <a href="/blog" class="transition hover:text-sky-300">Bài viết</a>
        <a href="/register" class="transition hover:text-sky-300">Tạo tài khoản</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Tài khoản</p>
      <nav class="mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm">
        <a href="/login" class="transition hover:text-sky-300">Đăng nhập</a>
        <a href="/app/profile" class="transition hover:text-sky-300">Khu vực người dùng</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-6 py-5 text-xs text-slate-500 lg:px-8">
      <span>© {year} EmerCard</span>
      <span>Thông tin được chia sẻ theo quyền truy cập</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
